*Heading
** H20.23: two C3D20 elements with surface-to-surface Coulomb sliding.
** SI units: metre, newton, pascal.
** Abaqus/Standard removes initial overclosure by a strain-free adjustment.
** This card therefore starts at zero gap and applies 21 micrometres of closure,
** matching the final geometry of the 1 micrometre Fuelsim/MOOSE penetration
** followed by a 20 micrometre prescribed displacement.
